# Design

## Source of truth
`design/tokens.json` → `{{tokens.generated.ts / tailwind theme}}`; BRAND.md §8 rules; DESIGN_SYSTEM.md components.
- Colours, spacing, radius, type only via tokens/semantic classes. Dark mode via semantic tokens, never `dark:` + raw colour pairs.
- Fonts: {{display}} / {{text}} with fallback `{{stack}}`; body ≥ 16 px; text scales to 200%.
- Icons only from {{icon set}}, sizes 16/20/24; icon-only buttons need an accessible name.
- Logo only from `design/brand/`; never redrawn in code.
| Enforced by | |
|---|---|
| `npm run contrast` (CI) | every contrast pair ≥ AA |
| review | tokens-only, icon set, logo use |

## Never
- Raw hex/rgb
- new font without updating BRAND.md
- colour as the only signal
